<div class="side-by-side">
  <h2>The Challenge</h2>

  <p>
    Devsisters, the studio behind the CookieRun franchise, were launching a new
    franchise entry called CookieRun: OvenSmash. To promote the launch, they
    needed an event that would reach their target audience of mobile gamers, and
    position OvenSmash as a fun and competitive experience for users already on
    mobile devices.
  </p>
</div>

