<div class="side-by-side">
  <p class="big">24 creators, 24 audiences</p>
  <p>
    We targeted the biggest creators in team-based competitive mobile gaming and
    OvenSmash's biggest competitors. Every player streamed the event to their
    own community, turning a single tournament into a shared experience across
    many channels at once.
  </p>
